      "GeneralBoatDescription": [
        "<p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 3.0px 0.0px; font: 12.5px Helvetica; color: #000000;\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong>2019/2026 HCB 53 Sueños </strong></p><p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 3.0px 0.0px; font: 12.5px Helvetica; color: #000000;\"><strong>(New Quad Yamaha 425 XTO)</strong></p><p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.5px Helvetica; color: #000000; min-height: 16.0px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.5px Helvetica; color: #000000;\">Unique opportunity to acquire fully updated HCB 53 Sueños for a fraction of the price a new build. Fresh off an extensive refit, this particular 53 is turn-key condition and ready for its new owner. Sporting brand new Yamaha 425 XTOs, a fresh whisper grey paint job, New Seakeeper 6, new generator, new Garmin electronics and a full teak deck with covering boards - there is not a comparable 53 Sueños on the current market. Whether it’s tendering to a superyacht, tournament fishing or anything in between, this vessel checks every box possible and is available for immediate delivery. </p><p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.5px Helvetica; color: #000000; min-height: 16.0px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.5px Helvetica; color: #000000;\">Notable features and updates include:</p><ul> <li style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.5px Helvetica; color: #000000;\">New Yamaha 425 XTOS </li> <li style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.5px Helvetica; color: #000000;\">New Seakeeper 6</li> <li style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.5px Helvetica; color: #000000;\">New Westerberke Generator </li> <li style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.5px Helvetica; color: #000000;\">New Whisper Grey Hull Paint </li> <li style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.5px Helvetica; color: #000000;\">New Medium Grey Hardtop and Metal Paint </li> <li style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.5px Helvetica; color: #000000;\">Upgraded Diamond Stitch Upholstery</li> <li style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.5px Helvetica; color: #000000;\">Custom Teak Deck and Covering Boards</li> <li style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.5px Helvetica; color: #000000;\">New Suite of Garmin Electronics </li> <li style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.5px Helvetica; color: #000000;\">Dual Row Seating with Teak Helm Chairs</li> <li style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.5px Helvetica; color: #000000;\">Forward Seating with High/Low Table</li> <li style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.5px Helvetica; color: #000000;\">Leaning Post Refrigeration </li> <li style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.5px Helvetica; color: #000000;\">Forward Freezer Box </li> <li style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.5px Helvetica; color: #000000;\">Forward Lounge Seating </li> <li style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.5px Helvetica; color: #000000;\">Extreme Audio Package </li> <li style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.5px Helvetica; color: #000000;\">Dual Side Dive Doors</li></ul><p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.5px Helvetica; color: #000000; min-height: 16.0px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px; font: 12.5px Helvetica; color: #000000;\">Available for showing by appointment in Coral Gables, FL</p>"
      ],
